<th id="S5.T1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" colspan="4"><span id="S5.T1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cost ($ / K requests)</span></th></tr>
